    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2057610082695999924",
      "url": "https://x.com/ms_erosofnyx/status/2057610082695999924",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/ms_erosofnyx/status/2057610082695999924",
      "text": "Welcome to Manila, GumberBear international Fans! 🇵🇭✨\n\nIf you’re flying in for the LenaMiu Fan Meet at UP Theater, here’s a quick guide to help you get there safely and smoothly:\n\n✈️ From Ninoy Aquino International Airport (NAIA):\n\nThe most convenient option is booking a ride via Grab. It’s safer, fixed-rate, and easier, especially if it’s your first time in Manila. Just input “UP Theater” as your destination.\n\n🚗 Travel time: around 1 to 1.5 hours depending on traffic (Manila traffic is real 😅).\n\n🚍 Public transport:\nIt’s cheaper, but can be confusing (multiple transfers like jeepneys, MRT, buses). If you’re not familiar with the system, Grab is highly recommended.\n\n⚠️ Friendly reminders:\n• Stay vigilant with your belongings at all times\n• Avoid unofficial taxis or random offers outside the airport\n• Some may overcharge foreigners, always check prices first\n• Keep your phone charged for navigation & booking rides\n\nIf your hotel is already around Quezon City / near UP Theater, just book a 𝐆𝐫𝐚𝐛 ride for the easiest and safest trip to the venue. It’s convenient, fixed-price, and less hassle, especially for international fans. 💖\n\n📍 From nearby hotels, travel time is usually around 10–20 minutes depending on traffic.\n\nStay safe, plan ahead, and see you all at UP Theater! 🇵🇭✨\n\n#LenaMiu #ลีน่าหมิว\n#MiuNatsha #หมิวณัชชา\n#lalinalena #ลีน่าลลินา",
